     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">If you’re interested in learning about robustness\r\nanalysis/sensitivity, come “stop by” either on zoom or in person.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">April 1, 3, 1pm-2:15pm (eastern)  on zoom and room 275\r\nGiltner at MSU<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Monday April 1 we will be working from:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/quantifying%20the%20robustness%20of%20causal%20inferences%20replacement%20of%20cases%202.pptx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/quantifying%2520the%2520robustness%2520of%2520causal%2520inferences%2520replacement%2520of%2520cases%25202.pptx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3gXcwqYhdHeS5CkuzQoAon\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,102,153)\">powerpoint</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,102,153)\"> for replacement of cases</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#308298\"> </span><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/quantifying%20the%20robustness%20of%20causal%20inferences%20replacement%20of%20cases.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/quantifying%2520the%2520robustness%2520of%2520causal%2520inferences%2520replacement%2520of%2520cases.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1BtplbdfH2THOlMrS5V712\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,102,153)\">[pdf of replacement of cases]</span></a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Wednesday April 3 we will be working from:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/quantifying%20the%20robustness%20of%20causal%20inferences%20for%20regression.pptx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/quantifying%2520the%2520robustness%2520of%2520causal%2520inferences%2520for%2520regression.pptx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1LJOkFBfCdqQrSSugt2rLh\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,102,153)\">powerpoint</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,102,153)\"> for correlation framework</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#308298\"> </span><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/quantifying%20the%20robustness%20of%20causal%20inferences%20for%20regression.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/quantifying%2520the%2520robustness%2520of%2520causal%2520inferences%2520for%2520regression.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1yYHK5367B7lMO4rMzI0mr\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,102,153)\">[pdf of correlation framework]</span></a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Quick%20Examples%20of%20Quantifying%20the%20Robustness%20to%20Invalidate.pptx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Quick%2520Examples%2520of%2520Quantifying%2520the%2520Robustness%2520to%2520Invalidate.pptx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ic_6N40sNi1LKkdXRHbVY\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,102,153)\">quick examples</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#308298\"> </span><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Quick%20Examples%20of%20Quantifying%20the%20Robustness%20to%20Invalidate.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Quick%2520Examples%2520of%2520Quantifying%2520the%2520Robustness%2520to%2520Invalidate.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Fe4LJEwVrdxY11hhqbZMr\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,102,153)\">[pdf of quick examples]</span></a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><br><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">To\r\nparticipate on zoom you will click on <a href=\"https://msu.zoom.us/j/783760435\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.zoom.us/j/783760435&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2eikYB2coGfsEolT_WvPT2\"><span style=\"color:blue\">https://msu.zoom.us/j/783760435</span></a>. \r\nDownload for 2 minutes and you will be ready.  I will start the zoom\r\nsession at the time of the meeting.  Or you can call in at <a href=\"tel:(415)%20762-9988\" value=\"+14157629988\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(415) 762-9988</a>\r\nor <a href=\"tel:(646)%20568-7788\" value=\"+16465687788\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(646) 568-7788</a>. Meeting ID is 783-760-435.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Please\r\ndo not engage zoom more than a few minutes before our meeting as I may be in\r\nanother Zoom meeting.  Thanks<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><br><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Check out the R Shiny app for sensitivity analysis<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(17,85,205)\"><a href=\"http://konfound-it.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://konfound-it.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1RTNrtlop0JMKC2qmdVd-r\"><span style=\"color:blue\">http://konfound-it.com</span></a></span><span style=\"color:black\">.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Konfound%20it%20R%20shiny%20announce.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Konfound%2520it%2520R%2520shiny%2520announce.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244522847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3GRuBReD-ZPte95fWzPRGK\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,153)\">R Shiny app </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,153)\">KonFound</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,153)\">-it</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><br><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\">Ken Frank<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:b